game monetary transactions.<br></li><li>A number of cosmetic options for your avatar, which are unlocked through Steam achievements.<br></li><li>Basic support for LAN matches.<br></li><li>Community-made maps (these are made outside of the game using UE4 {which is free to use}).<br></li><li>Original soundtrack.</li></ul>",
